      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Occupying a particularly private position within one of Enniscorthy’s most sought-after residential developments, located at the end of a very private cul-de-sac, no. 74 Bridgemeadow is a beautifully presented three-bedroom semi-detached home that is ready for immediate occupation.\r\nMeticulously maintained by its current owners, this delightful property offers a discreet and enviable position within the development, with excellent parking to the front, a private cobble lock driveway to the side, and convenient side access to the rear garden.\r\nThe property boasts a range of attractive features, including oil-fired central heating, solid fuel stove, woodgrain uPVC double-glazed windows, a fully fitted kitchen with separate utility area fitted in, a spacious and well-proportioned layout, three generously sized bedrooms with built-in wardrobes in all three bedrooms and the added benefit of a walk-in wardrobe off the main bedroom. \r\nBridgemeadow is a highly regarded residential development, popular for its attractive homes, generous green areas and excellent location. The development enjoys easy access to the M11 motorway and Enniscorthy town centre, while a host of everyday amenities are close by, including Lidl and Aldi supermarkets, Centra shop and service station, Enniscorthy Community College and Little Treasures Crèche, which is conveniently located within the development itself.\r\n\r\nAccommodation\r\nThe property features a bright and spacious entrance hallway, featuring tiled floor with carpeted staircase, access to a guest WC, comprising WC and wash hand basin with tiled flooring.\r\nThe kitchen/dining room is a generous and practical space, featuring laminate flooring, a fully fitted neutral kitchen with separate area for utility with ample additional fitted units, plumbed for washing machine. Returning to the hallway, the bright and spacious sitting room is laid to laminate flooring and features a welcoming ornate fireplace with solid fuel stove. \r\nUpstairs, there are three well-proportioned bedrooms, all benefiting from laminate flooring. All three bedrooms with built in wardrobes and the main bedroom features a walk-in wardrobe with ample storage shelving.\r\nBedrooms two and three are also generous in size and each benefit from built-in wardrobes. The main family bathroom has been re-modelled to include  WC, wash hand basin and bathtub with Triton power shower over, complemented by fully tiled walls, laminate flooring. \r\n\r\nOutside\r\nOne of the standout features of this property is its exceptionally generous rear garden. Fully enclosed by fencing, the garden has been carefully maintained and provides an excellent private outdoor space. The garden features landscaped lawn area and patio, ideal for outdoor relaxing and entertaining. Also features a most useful barna shed. \r\n\r\nOverall, No. 74 Bridgemeadow presents an excellent opportunity to acquire a well-maintained and spacious three-bedroom home in a popular residential development. Its private position, generous rear garden, ample parking and convenient location make it an appealing choice for those seeking a comfortable, low-maintenance home within easy reach of Enniscorthy town and the M11.\r\n\r\nSize -c. 96 sq. m. approx. \r\n\r\nIncluded\r\noven, hob, fridge freezer, dishwasher, Barna shed. \r\n\r\nServices\r\nMains electricity, mains water, mains drainage\r\n\r\nBER – C \r\n\r\nDirections\r\nY21 D7Y2\r\nFrom Enniscorthy take the Kiltealy/Kilkenny Road out of town and travel through roundabout at Lidl and Aldi down Milehouse Road hill and Bridgemeadow is located on left hand side.  Proceed into development, proceed right and keep right following the signs for 74. Sign on same."
      },
